*This scene occurs after the player defeats Moloch. Before transitioning to map 6, the screen cuts to black and this
dialogue scene occurs*

[START DIALOGUE]

Abaddon: Gadreela. Come, it is safe now, I know you are here.
[PRESS ENTER]
Gadreela: Hey... I'm not hungry anymore...
[PRESS ENTER]
Abaddon: Yes, Moloch's blood is enough to sustain you for seven... maybe ten years.
[PRESS ENTER]
*longer screenshake*
Abaddon: Damn! He's trying to bring this whole city down in his last effort. That spiteful...
[PRESS ENTER]
Abaddon: Gadreela, follow me. We must escape this city.
[PRESS ENTER]
Gadreela: Where will we go, Dad?
[PRESS ENTER]
Abaddon: We will head for the Middle Realm, where the Humans dwell.
[PRESS ENTER]
Gadreela: What if I get hungry again?
[PRESS ENTER]
Abaddon: There will be other beings from Hel. Including at least one Arch Angel I know of. Azazeel. Others are bound to come.
[PRESS ENTER]
[END]
